 text : beard follows the n of man, and it counts as inside a word. The picker shows at most 1000 emojis, from the start of this list. filterEmojis rounds a fractional limit up, as before the fix. When more emojis match, as for a single letter such as e, the picker shows the first 1000 of the ranked list. With an empty search text the picker lists emojis.json in file order, up to 1000. An emoji matches the search text when it matched before the fix. The fix changes the order of the list, and so it also changes which 1000 emojis show when more than 1000 match."}],"codeChanges":{"byStatus":{"added":17,"modified":3},"mappedFiles":19,"mappingGranularity":"file","outOfScopeFiles":["test/shell.d/emojis-test.sh"],"outOfScopeTotal":1,"totalFiles":20,"unmappedFiles":["proof.yaml"]},"compat":{"findings":[{"base":"# omarchy-bdiff v1 emojis\nopened loaded=1870\nshown query=\"\" count=1000 first=😀 cursor=0\ntop 😀 😃 😄 😁 😆 😅 🤣 😂 🙂 🙃 🫠 😉\ndigest order=90ea7832ca6f set=da28eebc5a1b\nshown query=\" OK\" count=36 first=💔 cursor=0\ntop 💔 👌 👍 👀 🙆 🙆‍♂️ 🙆‍♀️ 🧑‍🍳 👨‍🍳 👩‍🍳 🍳 🍚\ndigest order=896b1468179f set=e9174fd15e0a\nenter $OM","classification":"intended","evidence":{"command":"proof change behavior-diff --base 58cd8018b7ae7d6f96900e95c98b7d2fae3aacd0 --head afc304c3d2cada4e3671b3d3752c6764eedda69f","digest":"sha256:232622e33f13d5e204e2da77b87fa54fd6f6c96cc39a8d1aa95774cea4b2f297","excerpt":"# Verifies: SW-REQ-261004-H41S\n# Emoji picker: a leading space and capitals; the picker trims and ignores case.\n@emojis\n@type  OK\n@enter\n"},"head":"# omarchy-bdiff v1 emojis\nopened loaded=1870\nshown query=\"\" count=1000 first=😀 cursor=0\ntop 😀 😃 😄 😁 😆 😅 🤣 😂 🙂 🙃 🫠 😉\ndigest order=90ea7832ca6f set=da28eebc5a1b\nshown query=\" OK\" count=36 first=👌 cursor=0\ntop 👌 👍 🙆 🙆‍♂️ 🙆‍♀️ 🆗 💔 👀 🧑‍🍳 👨‍🍳 👩‍🍳 🍳\ndigest order=46ff71880951 set=e9174fd15e0a\nenter $OM","id":"cf-38dbca455384f2c8","path":"lifecycle","requirement":"SW-REQ-261004-H41S","source":"differential","status":"unapproved","what":"Output dif